    "不从比例推算Token数量；上下文与单次执行用量分别读取。历史稳定后停止轮询，关闭面板或退后台后停止读取。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Token counts are not inferred from ratios. Context and per-run usage are read separately. Polling stops once history is stable; reads stop when the panel closes or the app enters the background."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不从比例推算Token数量；上下文与单次执行用量分别读取。历史稳定后停止轮询，关闭面板或退后台后停止读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不会重置 Git 或改写工程文件。原程序可能继续写它自己的日志；导入快照保持只读。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Git is not reset and project files are not rewritten. The original program may keep writing its own logs; imported snapshots stay read-only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不会重置 Git 或改写工程文件。原程序可能继续写它自己的日志；导入快照保持只读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
