    "只处理已预览的明确对象；保留本地数据、其他副本与远端墓碑，中断后先核对原结果。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Process only the specific previewed objects. Preserve local data, other copies and remote tombstones. After interruption, reconcile the original result first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
