    "生成的使命等待你启动。主机按此时区计算，夏令时重复时刻只执行一次，跳过不存在的时刻。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Created missions wait for you to start them. The host uses this time zone. Repeated daylight-saving times run once; nonexistent times are skipped."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "生成的使命等待你启动。主机按此时区计算，夏令时重复时刻只执行一次，跳过不存在的时刻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用于之后的新执行；实际档位以运行程序反馈为准。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
